<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Tio Higno Barbearia | Agende seu horário</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Tio Higno Barbearia — corte, barba e estilo. Agende seu horário online em poucos segundos." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/mobile-hotfix.css" />
  <style>.brand-logo{width:43px;height:43px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;display:block}</style>
  <style>
     .hero-logo{display:block;width:min(78%,280px);height:auto;margin:18px auto 20px;object-fit:contain}


    :root{--bg:#0b0b0a;--bg2:#11110f;--panel:#161613;--panel2:#1d1c18;--gold:#d4aa5c;--gold2:#f0cf89;--text:#f4f0e8;--muted:#99958d;--line:#2d2b26;--white:#fff;--danger:#e66b6b;--green:#6ed69a}
    body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}.header{background:rgba(11,11,10,.92);border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.06)}.nav a{color:#c3beb4}.menu-btn{color:#fff}.btn{color:var(--text)}.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold2),#b98735);color:#16110a}.btn-ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}.hero-card{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#22211b,#0e0e0d)}.barber-art{background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 28%,#44391f 0,#1c1b17 35%,#0c0c0b 70%)}.floating-card{background:rgba(25,24,20,.94);border-color:#363229;color:var(--text)}.ticker{background:#11100e;color:#8f8779}.service-card,.booking-app,.experience-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#171714,#11110f)}.service-icon,.choice,.date-btn,.slot,.field input,.field textarea,.summary-box{background:#191916}.choice:hover,.choice.active{background:#211e18}.booking-section{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#12110f,#0c0c0b)}.progress{background:#22211e}.hair-card{background-color:#181713}.hair-card:before{background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.85),transparent 65%)}footer{background:#090908}.whatsapp{background:#d5ad61;color:#111}.toast{background:#25231d;color:#fff;border-color:#4a4539}.reveal,.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
  </style>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0b0b0a!important;--bg2:#11110f!important;--panel:#161613!important;--panel2:#1d1c18!important;--gold:#d4aa5c!important;--gold2:#f0cf89!important;--text:#f4f0e8!important;--muted:#99958d!important;--line:#2d2b26!important}
    .service-card h3{color:#fff!important}.service-card p,.service-card small{color:#c9c3b7!important}
    .choice b{color:#fff!important}.choice small{color:#c9c3b7!important}.choice .price{color:#f0cf89!important}
    #stepTitle{color:#fff!important}
    .experience-card h2{color:#fff!important}.experience-card h2 em{color:#f0cf89!important}
    body,.header,.ticker,.booking-section,footer{background:#0b0b0a!important;color:#f4f0e8!important}.header{background:rgba(11,11,10,.92)!important;border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.06)!important}.ticker{background:#11100e!important}.booking-section{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#12110f,#0c0c0b)!important}footer{background:#090908!important}.service-card,.booking-app,.experience-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#171714,#11110f)!important}.service-icon,.choice,.date-btn,.slot,.field input,.field textarea,.summary-box{background:#191916!important;color:#f4f0e8!important}.hero-card{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#22211b,#0e0e0d)!important}.barber-art{background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 28%,#44391f 0,#1c1b17 35%,#0c0c0b 70%)!important}.floating-card{background:rgba(25,24,20,.94)!important;color:#f4f0e8!important;border-color:#363229!important}.nav a{color:#c3beb4!important}.menu-btn{color:#fff!important}.reveal,.reveal.visible{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}
  </style>
  <style>
    .booking-app{border:1px solid rgba(212,170,92,.28)!important;border-radius:24px!important;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#191815,#0f0f0d)!important;box-shadow:0 28px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.42),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.025) inset!important}
    .app-header{padding:25px 28px 20px!important;background:linear-gradient(110deg,rgba(212,170,92,.08),transparent 55%)!important}
    .app-header small{font-size:10px!important;letter-spacing:.24em!important;color:var(--gold2)!important}
    .app-header strong{font-size:25px!important;color:#fff!important;letter-spacing:-.01em}
    .app-header>span{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid rgba(212,170,92,.25);border-radius:999px;color:var(--gold2)!important;background:rgba(212,170,92,.06);height:max-content}
    .progress{height:4px!important;background:#29251e!important}.progress i{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--gold2))!important;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(240,207,137,.35)}
    .app-body{padding:28px!important;background:radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0,rgba(212,170,92,.06),transparent 35%)!important;opacity:1;transition:opacity .12s ease, transform .12s ease}.app-body.is-updating{opacity:.52;transform:translateY(4px)}
    .choice-grid{gap:12px!important}.choice{border:1px solid #363128!important;border-radius:16px!important;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)!important;padding:18px!important;transition:border-color .2s,background .2s,transform .2s,box-shadow .2s!important}.choice:hover{border-color:#8d6a32!important;background:rgba(212,170,92,.07)!important;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}.choice.active{border-color:var(--gold)!important;background:rgba(212,170,92,.12)!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(212,170,92,.18) inset!important}.choice b{font-size:15px!important;color:#fff!important}.choice small{line-height:1.45!important;color:#bcb5a9!important}.choice .price{font-size:16px!important;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold2)!important}.choice .icon{font-size:21px!important;margin-bottom:12px!important}
    .date-row{gap:9px!important}.date-btn,.slot{border-color:#363128!important;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)!important;color:#f4f0e8!important;transition:.2s!important}.date-btn:hover,.date-btn.active,.slot:hover{border-color:var(--gold)!important;background:rgba(212,170,92,.12)!important}.date-btn{padding:13px 5px!important}.slot{font-weight:600!important}.summary-box{border:1px solid rgba(212,170,92,.3)!important;border-radius:18px!important;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(212,170,92,.1),rgba(255,255,255,.025))!important;padding:20px!important;box-shadow:0 18px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}.summary-row{padding:11px 0!important;border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.1)!important}.summary-row span{color:#aaa298!important}.summary-row b{color:#fff!important}.summary-row:last-child b{color:var(--gold2)!important;font-size:17px}
    .app-footer{padding:20px 28px!important;background:rgba(0,0,0,.16)!important;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08)!important}.app-footer .btn{min-height:46px!important;padding-inline:20px!important}.app-footer .btn-primary{box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(199,151,71,.2)!important}
    @media(max-width:650px){.app-header{padding:21px 20px 17px!important}.app-header strong{font-size:21px!important}.app-body{padding:20px!important}.app-footer{padding:16px 20px!important}.choice{padding:16px!important}.summary-box{padding:16px!important}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="noise"></div>
  <header class="header">
    <a href="#inicio" class="brand" aria-label="Tio Higno Barbearia">
      <img class="brand-logo" src="/logo.png.png" alt="Tio Higno Barbearia" />
      <span class="brand-copy"><strong>TIO HIGNO</strong><small>BARBEARIA</small></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#servicos">Serviços</a><a href="#experiencia">Experiência</a><a href="#trabalhos">Trabalhos</a><a href="#contato">Contato</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#agendar" class="btn btn-small">Agendar horário</a>
    <button class="menu-btn" aria-label="Abrir menu">☰</button>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="hero-glow"></div>
      <div class="hero-content reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow"><i></i> ESTILO • PRECISÃO • EXPERIÊNCIA</span>
        <h1>Seu estilo.<br><em>Seu horário.</em></h1>
        <p>Cortes de personalidade, atendimento de excelência e uma experiência feita para você — do agendamento ao acabamento final.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#agendar" class="btn btn-primary">✂ Agendar meu horário</a>
          <a href="#trabalhos" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver nossos trabalhos →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof">
          <div class="avatars"><span>TH</span><span>MT</span><span>CA</span><span>+99</span></div>
          <div><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><small>Clientes que voltam pelo cuidado</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual reveal delay">
        <div class="hero-card card-main">
          <div class="barber-art">
            <span class="line-art scissors">✂</span>
            <div class="art-copy"><small>DESDE 2019</small><img class="hero-logo" src="/logo.png.png" alt="Tio Higno Barbearia"><span>BARBER CLUB</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-card fc-top"><span>✓</span><div><b>Agendamento fácil</b><small>Em menos de 1 minuto</small></div></div>
        <div class="floating-card fc-bottom"><span>★</span><div><b>Experiência premium</b><small>Do início ao acabamento</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ticker"><div>✦ CORTE PREMIUM &nbsp; ✦ BARBA &nbsp; ✦ CORTE + BARBA &nbsp; ✦ ACABAMENTO &nbsp; ✦ SOBRANCELHA &nbsp; ✦ EXPERIÊNCIA TIO HIGNO &nbsp;</div></section>

    <section class="section services" id="servicos">
      <div class="section-head reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">SERVIÇOS</span><h2>Escolha sua <em>experiência.</em></h2></div><p>Do clássico ao moderno, cada detalhe é pensado para valorizar seu estilo.</p></div>
      <div class="service-grid" id="serviceGrid"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="booking-section" id="agendar">
      <div class="booking-copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">AGENDE ONLINE</span>
        <h2>Seu próximo corte começa <em>aqui.</em></h2>
        <p>Escolha o serviço, profissional e o melhor horário. Sem ligações, sem espera.</p>
        <div class="booking-benefits"><span>✓ Confirmação imediata</span><span>✓ Horários em tempo real</span><span>✓ Processo rápido</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="booking-app reveal delay">
        <div class="app-header"><div><small>AGENDAMENTO</small><strong id="stepTitle">Escolha um serviço</strong></div><span id="stepCounter">1 / 5</span></div>
        <div class="progress"><i id="progressBar"></i></div>
        <div class="app-body" id="bookingBody"></div>
        <div class="app-footer"><button id="backBtn" class="btn btn-ghost hidden">← Voltar</button><button id="nextBtn" class="btn btn-primary" disabled>Continuar →</button></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="experience section" id="experiencia">
      <div class="experience-card reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">A EXPERIÊNCIA TIO HIGNO</span><h2>Mais que um corte.<br><em>Um ritual.</em></h2>
        <p>Ambiente confortável, atenção aos detalhes e profissionais que entendem o seu estilo.</p>
        <div class="stats"><div><strong>5★</strong><small>Atendimento</small></div><div><strong>100%</strong><small>Compromisso</small></div><div><strong>+1K</strong><small>Cortes realizados</small></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="experience-list reveal delay">
        <article><b>01</b><div><h3>Você no controle</h3><p>Agende pelo celular a qualquer hora e escolha quem vai cuidar do seu visual.</p></div></article>
        <article><b>02</b><div><h3>Detalhes fazem diferença</h3><p>Do diagnóstico do corte ao acabamento, cada etapa recebe atenção especial.</p></div></article>
        <article><b>03</b><div><h3>Seu tempo importa</h3><p>Agenda organizada para reduzir espera e deixar sua experiência mais prática.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section gallery" id="trabalhos">
      <div class="section-head reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">NOSSO TRABALHO</span><h2>Estilo que <em>fala por você.</em></h2></div><a href="#agendar" class="text-link">Quero meu horário →</a></div>
      <div class="gallery-grid">
        <div class="hair-card g1"><span>FADE</span></div><div class="hair-card g2"><span>CLÁSSICO</span></div><div class="hair-card g3"><span>BARBA</span></div><div class="hair-card g4"><span>MODERNO</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">PRONTO PARA MUDAR O VISUAL?</span><h2>Seu horário está a<br><em>poucos cliques.</em></h2><a href="#agendar" class="btn btn-primary">Agendar agora ✂</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer id="contato">
    <div class="footer-brand"><div class="brand"><img class="brand-logo" src="/logo.png.png" alt="Tio Higno Barbearia" /><span class="brand-copy"><strong>TIO HIGNO</strong><small>BARBEARIA</small></span></div><p>Seu estilo. Seu horário.</p></div>
    <div><b>CONTATO</b><a id="footerPhone" href="#">(64) 99999-9999</a><a id="footerInstagram" href="#">@tiohignobarbearia</a></div>
    <div><b>LOCALIZAÇÃO</b><span id="footerAddress">Av. Brasil, Centro</span><span>Seg–Sáb • Consulte horários</span></div>
    <div><b>ACESSO</b><a href="/admin">Painel administrativo</a></div>
  </footer>
  <a class="whatsapp" id="whatsappBtn" href="#" target="_blank" aria-label="WhatsApp">✆</a>
  <div id="toast" class="toast"></div>
  <script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
